WEBVTT

00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:04.400
You want to participate in the Duel Carnival?

00:00:06.860 --> 00:00:10.780
Yes. Please grant me this wish.

00:00:10.780 --> 00:00:13.570
It's growing painful just watching.

00:00:13.570 --> 00:00:14.860
Oh?

00:00:15.410 --> 00:00:18.950
So your fighting spirit is fired up, is that it?

00:00:20.330 --> 00:00:22.080
Then it cannot be helped.

00:00:22.080 --> 00:00:23.830
Thank you very much.

00:00:23.830 --> 00:00:25.790
But Gauche...

00:00:26.710 --> 00:00:29.290
If you enter and you wind up losing...

00:00:29.960 --> 00:00:32.300
...you know what the consequences are, right?

00:00:32.300 --> 00:00:33.800
I understand.

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:37.090
I'll definitely make it to the finals and... that...

00:00:44.940 --> 00:00:47.060
Your goal is Yuma Tsukumo.

00:00:47.060 --> 00:00:48.060
Yeah.

00:00:49.150 --> 00:00:52.110
But he has Numbers.

00:00:52.650 --> 00:00:54.570
And he has the Original.

00:00:55.950 --> 00:00:57.570
Do you have some sort of plan?

00:00:58.070 --> 00:00:59.700
I don't have anything of the sort.

00:00:59.700 --> 00:01:02.080
I just gotta fight with this!

00:01:03.370 --> 00:01:07.830
Did you seal off the deck that Mr. Heartland gave you?

00:01:08.250 --> 00:01:10.920
Yeah, I won't use something I borrowed!

00:01:10.920 --> 00:01:12.880
I will fight with my own deck!

00:01:12.880 --> 00:01:17.180
And defeating the Original Number is...

00:01:19.890 --> 00:01:22.560
...the only way to beat him--Kaito!

00:01:22.930 --> 00:01:23.680
Gauche...

00:01:24.770 --> 00:01:27.310
Droite, what will you do?

00:01:27.310 --> 00:01:30.810
Kaito will definitely win and make it to the finals.

00:01:33.150 --> 00:01:37.820
To qualify for the finals, we will need to collect five Heart Pieces by the end of the day.

00:01:38.660 --> 00:01:41.660
We can do it if we work together.

00:01:41.660 --> 00:01:42.870
Yeah...

00:01:45.700 --> 00:01:47.710
What's with Old Man Rokujuro?

00:01:49.000 --> 00:01:51.420
He actually went home while I was asleep.

00:01:51.420 --> 00:01:54.340
Come now, he was at peace of mind.

00:01:54.880 --> 00:01:59.340
Yuma, will you keep moving forward on your own path?

00:02:00.720 --> 00:02:03.350
The path I choose…

00:02:04.970 --> 00:02:10.230
You're aiming to be World Duel Champion, right? You already got this far, so work until the last moment!

00:02:10.230 --> 00:02:11.690
Sis…

00:02:12.270 --> 00:02:13.070
Bing...

00:02:13.730 --> 00:02:14.820
Bing...

00:02:14.860 --> 00:02:18.200
Yuma. Duel Lunch. Duel Lunch.

00:02:18.200 --> 00:02:21.780
Oh?! Great stuff! Thanks, Obomi!

00:02:21.780 --> 00:02:24.240
Do your best, Yuma.

00:02:24.240 --> 00:02:28.120
You suck. Work hard. You suck. Work hard.

00:02:29.750 --> 00:02:32.710
I do not suck!

00:02:32.710 --> 00:02:34.800
Well, I'm off!

00:02:37.170 --> 00:02:38.880
Morning, Yuma!

00:02:38.880 --> 00:02:41.640
Kotori… Tetsuo… Everyone!

00:02:42.550 --> 00:02:43.390
Whoa there.

00:02:43.390 --> 00:02:47.850
What’s going on? Class Rep, are you alright?

00:02:47.850 --> 00:02:52.020
Yes. Although I can’t say I am in perfect shape, to summa-

00:02:52.020 --> 00:02:55.190
In other words, everyone from the Numbers Club got together!

00:02:55.190 --> 00:02:56.900
We come here to cheer for you, Yuma!

00:02:58.320 --> 00:03:02.530
You guys… I guess you can never go wrong with treasuring your friends!

00:03:03.070 --> 00:03:05.870
Yuma seems pretty energetic, does’t he?

00:03:05.870 --> 00:03:07.040
Yeah.

00:03:07.700 --> 00:03:12.500
<i>After many intense battles, the final day of the Duel Carnival finally begins!</i>

00:03:12.500 --> 00:03:16.920
<i>Which of you warriors will manage to gather enough Heart Pieces?</i>

00:03:16.920 --> 00:03:18.960
<i>Heart Burning!</i>

00:03:18.960 --> 00:03:23.930
Since you already got this far, you goal should aim all the way for the finals...no, winning it all!

00:03:23.930 --> 00:03:30.680
Of course I will! No matter how strong the finalists are, I'm gonna win for sure!

00:03:32.350 --> 00:03:33.900
H-Hey...

00:03:34.520 --> 00:03:35.230
Yuma?

00:03:35.860 --> 00:03:40.610
Gramps said I need to find my own path...

00:03:43.240 --> 00:03:46.910
I've been thinking about this for a while, but I still haven't found an answer.

00:03:47.530 --> 00:03:53.620
The path that permits you to save Kaito, Haruto, Shark, and your father.

00:03:53.620 --> 00:03:58.750
You too, Astral! I don’t want to lose anyone!

00:04:01.340 --> 00:04:02.670
Yuma…

00:04:03.970 --> 00:04:08.680
Uhh…no… I meant... Right.

00:04:08.680 --> 00:04:12.810
I'll find a path that makes all of us happy!

00:04:12.810 --> 00:04:15.770
A path that will make us all happy?

00:04:16.560 --> 00:04:20.480
As long as you become Duel Champion, I'll be happy!

00:04:20.480 --> 00:04:23.030
Yeah, I'd be honored as well!

00:04:23.030 --> 00:04:23.900
Me too!

00:04:23.900 --> 00:04:28.580
You need Heart Pieces to qualify for the finals. How many do you have so far?

00:04:29.330 --> 00:04:32.450
Right! I already got four Heart Pieces.

00:04:32.450 --> 00:04:34.960
Okay, this is for Yuma!

00:04:34.960 --> 00:04:40.090
Let’s go and find remaining Duelists!

00:04:40.090 --> 00:04:42.170
If possible, the weak ones!

00:04:42.170 --> 00:04:44.840
I doubt there'd be many weaklings left...

00:04:44.840 --> 00:04:47.470
Even so, we got to find them! The weaklings!

00:04:47.890 --> 00:04:49.850
Weaklings!

00:04:50.390 --> 00:04:51.470
Hey now...

00:04:51.470 --> 00:04:52.720
Let's go search!

00:04:52.720 --> 00:04:53.890
Right!

00:04:55.370 --> 00:04:58.040
<i>As I get closer, I stretch my hand out</i>

00:04:58.040 --> 00:05:01.090
<i>towards that shining light leading towards tomorrow</i>

00:05:01.260 --> 00:05:08.350
<i>I dream of a world that expands from my feet.</i>

00:05:12.100 --> 00:05:17.610
<i>I haven't a clue of where things like dreams and hopes are at.</i>

00:05:17.610 --> 00:05:22.110
<i>Even if I run looking for it, I still can't seem to find it.</i>

00:05:23.070 --> 00:05:28.570
<i>I wonder if I have fallen into a gap of truth and lies.</i>

00:05:28.570 --> 00:05:33.370
<i>Even so, our grand tale has yet to begin.</i>

00:05:33.790 --> 00:05:39.040
<i>Let's move on towards tomorrow, 
even if our road begins to fall apart.</i>

00:05:39.040 --> 00:05:44.300
<i>I will jump forward, before all my
 strength completely drains.</i>

00:05:44.720 --> 00:05:47.180
<i>The closer I get, the further it becomes,</i>

00:05:47.300 --> 00:05:50.470
<i>that truth that I must seize.</i>

00:05:50.470 --> 00:05:55.640
<i>It's to find hope that we desire from a future unseen.</i>

00:05:55.640 --> 00:05:58.230
<i>With a heart stronger than anyone else,</i>

00:05:58.440 --> 00:06:01.400
<i>I'll learn to keep running up.</i>

00:06:01.730 --> 00:06:06.950
<i>With the strength to win any battle, 
despite just how weak I am,</i>

00:06:07.470 --> 00:06:09.450
<i>My purpose is to find,</i>

00:06:09.470 --> 00:06:12.450
<i>with these invaluable friends of mine,</i>

00:06:12.470 --> 00:06:19.250
<i>The future of the world expanding
 from my feet with my own eyes.</i>

00:06:26.240 --> 00:06:29.280
The remaining ones... the remaining ones...

00:06:29.320 --> 00:06:33.780
Let's see... Weak duelists... weak...

00:06:34.490 --> 00:06:39.170
Numbers 45: A Nemesis Shows Up Late!
Robin VS Gauche!

00:06:37.830 --> 00:06:39.290
Tell me if you happen to find someone.

00:06:39.540 --> 00:06:42.540
If possible, find a relatively weaker duelist for an opponent, please.

00:06:44.630 --> 00:06:51.010
Weak duelists...
Guys like that should be hiding in this an alleyway.

00:07:07.940 --> 00:07:10.530
He's that scary Operation Committee member!

00:07:19.000 --> 00:07:21.250
H-Her too?!

00:07:34.010 --> 00:07:37.520
Every single one of them turned out to be total newbs.

00:07:38.680 --> 00:07:42.020
But now we have 3 Heart Pieces.

00:07:43.650 --> 00:07:44.860
<i>Those two...</i>

00:07:47.650 --> 00:07:52.860
I attack directly with Different Dimension Esper Star Robin!

00:07:53.410 --> 00:07:55.950
Big Surprise Punch!!

00:08:03.540 --> 00:08:04.250
Did you see that?

00:08:05.250 --> 00:08:07.500
That was the big banquet of victory!

00:08:10.420 --> 00:08:11.920
Please give me your autograph!

00:08:13.550 --> 00:08:16.300
Hey guys, can I give out autographs later?

00:08:16.720 --> 00:08:17.930
Out of the way!!

00:08:19.560 --> 00:08:22.600
You look like you're not half bad.

00:08:23.850 --> 00:08:26.520
So you are now a Duel Carnival participant, right?

00:08:27.480 --> 00:08:29.190
Yep, as of today.

00:08:29.860 --> 00:08:30.610
Me too.

00:08:31.530 --> 00:08:35.450
I wasn't able to participate the 
last two days since I was busy in the studio.

00:08:36.410 --> 00:08:39.410
I really hope I can get the 4th Heart Piece from you.

00:08:39.910 --> 00:08:43.540
Interesting. I'll give those words back to you.

00:08:44.080 --> 00:08:47.540
Don't let your guard down.. He got three Heart Pieces in one day.

00:08:47.920 --> 00:08:50.090
That's why I said it's interesting.

00:08:53.010 --> 00:08:55.260
Even Robin appeared!

00:08:59.260 --> 00:09:01.020
Here goes! I challenge you!

00:09:03.270 --> 00:09:04.940
Duel Disk, set!

00:09:08.230 --> 00:09:09.980
Duel Disk, set!

00:09:16.360 --> 00:09:18.700
<i>AR Vision - Link established.</i>

00:09:20.120 --> 00:09:20.620
Duel!!

00:09:22.870 --> 00:09:24.040
Tokunosuke!

00:09:25.080 --> 00:09:25.750
Yuma!

00:09:26.000 --> 00:09:28.080
Just what's going on here?

00:09:28.290 --> 00:09:28.880
Kotori!

00:09:29.500 --> 00:09:30.840
Sei! Sachi!

00:09:30.960 --> 00:09:33.420
So you really did come here to cheer for Robin-<i>sama</i>!

00:09:33.760 --> 00:09:35.220
Ah... It's Robin-<i>sama</i>!

00:09:38.590 --> 00:09:42.260
Robin! I can't believe he's in the tournament too!

00:09:43.140 --> 00:09:45.770
I'll Special Summon this guy in Defense mode!

00:09:46.770 --> 00:09:49.690
Come forth, Ironhammer the Iron Giant!

00:09:53.110 --> 00:09:55.190
Whoa! Awesome!

00:09:55.950 --> 00:09:59.240
All of Robin's heroes are assembled on the field!

00:10:00.740 --> 00:10:03.450
It's Different Dimension ESPer Star Robin and his friends!

00:10:04.910 --> 00:10:06.750
Each one of them is an excellent monster...

00:10:07.370 --> 00:10:11.460
Just recalling that match makes my heart throb with joy.

00:10:17.130 --> 00:10:17.800
Yuma...

00:10:18.970 --> 00:10:21.390
But Robin's opponent is no pushover!

00:10:22.350 --> 00:10:24.810
Yeah. His opponent is Gauche.

00:10:25.560 --> 00:10:28.390
But why's he fighting Robin?

00:10:28.770 --> 00:10:32.270
It seems he resigned his position as an Operation Committee member in order to participate in the tournament.

00:10:36.900 --> 00:10:39.660
Hey, take a good look at how I duel!

00:10:40.070 --> 00:10:42.070
So he's in the tournament too...

00:10:42.580 --> 00:10:46.830
Wait a sec, Gauche's monsters aren't the same ones we fought back then?

00:10:49.040 --> 00:10:51.750
So he changed his deck for the WDC?

00:10:52.170 --> 00:10:54.340
But in his current situation,

00:10:54.460 --> 00:10:56.510
he's no match for Robin's heroes!

00:10:57.010 --> 00:11:00.050
Go, Star Robin! Attack Spartas!

00:11:01.970 --> 00:11:07.140
I'll give you a good look at the power of my Heroic Challenger Spartas!

00:11:09.940 --> 00:11:11.310
Heroic Formation!

00:11:13.190 --> 00:11:15.480
When my opponent's monster declares an attack,

00:11:15.690 --> 00:11:18.650
these monsters can form the formation 
and combine their Attack power!

00:11:19.320 --> 00:11:21.280
Not good, Robin will be..

00:11:21.700 --> 00:11:24.780
No, Robin's attack hasn't necessarily been sealed yet.

00:11:25.330 --> 00:11:26.040
Not bad!

00:11:26.910 --> 00:11:29.710
Trap card! Change! The Jet Iron!

00:11:30.790 --> 00:11:34.420
By releasing the Robin family on the field...

00:11:35.540 --> 00:11:38.130
...this card can Special Summon The Different Dimension Jet Iron...

00:11:39.300 --> 00:11:43.470
...and its Attack power become the 
grand total of the released monsters!

00:11:45.430 --> 00:11:47.680
Come forth, Different Dimension Jet Iron!!

00:11:49.060 --> 00:11:50.350
8000 attack points?

00:11:50.810 --> 00:11:52.810
Go, Different Dimension Jet Iron!

00:11:53.650 --> 00:11:55.020
Iron Phoenix!!

00:11:57.270 --> 00:11:59.900
Trap, activate! Heroic Guard!

00:12:00.990 --> 00:12:05.450
By releasing one Spartas, the damage I take will decrease by its Attack power!

00:12:15.710 --> 00:12:18.670
I open another Trap card!

00:12:19.420 --> 00:12:22.470
I activate the Permanent Trap, Heroic Revenge Sword!

00:12:23.470 --> 00:12:26.970
This card can be activated when a 'Heroic Challenger' monster was destroyed.

00:12:27.550 --> 00:12:29.970
When a monster equipped by this card battles,

00:12:30.100 --> 00:12:32.810
It will destroy the monster which destroyed that Heroic Challenger!

00:12:33.140 --> 00:12:37.020
And inflict damage to the player equal to its Attack power!

00:12:40.320 --> 00:12:43.070
That means Robin will receive 8000 damage!?

00:12:43.320 --> 00:12:44.410
Here comes the reversal!

00:12:44.860 --> 00:12:45.860
I won't let that happen!

00:12:46.570 --> 00:12:49.660
I activate Different Dimension Jet Iron's monster effect!

00:12:52.250 --> 00:12:56.000
By releasing this card, I can call forth these 4 monsters from the Cemetery!

00:12:57.460 --> 00:12:58.590
So that's your resort?!

00:12:58.790 --> 00:13:01.920
Now Heroics Revenge Sword's effect will vanish.

00:13:03.720 --> 00:13:07.220
That was an excellent counter. You're quite spirited.

00:13:07.890 --> 00:13:08.760
You too.

00:13:09.850 --> 00:13:13.100
Looks like I got a great opponent.

00:13:14.270 --> 00:13:18.520
Since Gairuda was Special Summoned, I get to draw one card.

00:13:19.230 --> 00:13:20.150
I end my turn.

00:13:21.190 --> 00:13:23.570
Awesome! Awesome!!

00:13:23.900 --> 00:13:27.660
Gauche's fighting style is so passionate and Robin's dueling is gorgeous!

00:13:27.660 --> 00:13:29.990
They're both really amazing!

00:13:30.240 --> 00:13:32.830
Man, I wanna duel too!

00:13:33.870 --> 00:13:38.670
The remaining Spartas are chanting to me, asking me to avenge their comrade!

00:13:39.420 --> 00:13:41.420
My turn! Draw!

00:13:42.500 --> 00:13:45.510
I release Spartas to Advance summon!

00:13:46.680 --> 00:13:49.760
Come forth, Heroic Challenger - War Hammer!!

00:13:50.350 --> 00:13:53.140
Go, attack Beast Warrior Puman!

00:14:05.190 --> 00:14:06.650
Oh-no! Robin is...!

00:14:09.240 --> 00:14:09.910
Puman...

00:14:10.620 --> 00:14:12.030
Since Puman was destroyed,

00:14:12.700 --> 00:14:14.830
I'll be taking his burning spirit!

00:14:15.290 --> 00:14:15.700
What?

00:14:16.500 --> 00:14:19.080
I activate War Hammer's monster effect!

00:14:19.830 --> 00:14:22.500
The monster it destroyed by battle becomes an equipment card

00:14:22.880 --> 00:14:26.420
And War Hammer gains Attack power equal to the Attack power of the equipped monster!

00:14:27.010 --> 00:14:30.470
Awesome! Is this Gauche's real strength?

00:14:31.260 --> 00:14:33.220
He's a lot different than before.

00:14:34.430 --> 00:14:36.730
I can't believe my comrade's power got taken away!

00:14:38.440 --> 00:14:41.520
I set one card and end my turn!

00:14:43.900 --> 00:14:49.570
The monsters on Robin's field are 
no match of Gauche's War Hammer!

00:14:51.280 --> 00:14:52.990
But look at his face!

00:14:54.740 --> 00:14:57.120
Robin hasn't given up yet!

00:14:58.790 --> 00:15:04.090
<i>Even in a pinch, never give up. 
Always believe in yourself...</i>

00:15:05.840 --> 00:15:08.800
<i>That's the 'bring it to 'em' I learned from Yuma!</i>

00:15:09.970 --> 00:15:12.140
My turn! Draw!

00:15:16.770 --> 00:15:21.060
From my hand, I activate the Magic card Galaxy Queen's Light!

00:15:22.190 --> 00:15:25.820
With this card, by selecting one monster on my field,

00:15:25.900 --> 00:15:31.450
all other monsters on my field will have the same level of the target monster until the end phase!

00:15:32.410 --> 00:15:35.370
I choose my Level-10 Different Dimension ESPer Star Robin!

00:15:36.620 --> 00:15:39.410
The mother of all galaxies, please give power to my heroes!

00:15:40.790 --> 00:15:43.790
I overlay my Level-10 Robin family!

00:15:45.040 --> 00:15:47.670
I build the Overlay Network with these 3 monsters!

00:15:49.590 --> 00:15:50.920
Xyz Summon!

00:15:54.680 --> 00:15:57.140
Come forth! Super Dimensional Robot!

00:16:00.850 --> 00:16:02.640
Galaxy Destroyer!

00:16:06.730 --> 00:16:08.230
5000 Attack power?!

00:16:08.900 --> 00:16:11.610
Awesome, Robin- no, Fuya!

00:16:12.200 --> 00:16:13.950
The way he duels is much different than before!

00:16:14.320 --> 00:16:19.500
Indeed! Breaking his mother's spell 
pushed him to a whole new level.

00:16:20.370 --> 00:16:23.920
<i>Interesting. Then I'll fight 'til the end as well!</i>

00:16:25.130 --> 00:16:30.760
<i>But the moment you declare an attack, your monster is finished.</i>

00:16:32.630 --> 00:16:36.850
<i>That trap card Gauche set must be the Trap Card Reactive Armor.</i>

00:16:37.100 --> 00:16:43.060
<i>When the opposing monster attacks, that trap card can destroy almost any monster!</i>

00:16:45.060 --> 00:16:48.650
I activate Galaxy Destroyer' monster effect!

00:16:49.940 --> 00:16:56.740
By detaching one overlay unit, it destroys all Magic and Trap cards on my opponent's field!

00:16:57.740 --> 00:16:59.030
Galaxy Break!

00:17:00.290 --> 00:17:00.910
What?!

00:17:05.290 --> 00:17:09.290
War Hammer's Attack power now returns to 2100!

00:17:10.170 --> 00:17:13.220
Go, Super Dimensional - Robot Galaxy Destroyer!

00:17:13.880 --> 00:17:15.590
Attack War Hammer!

00:17:18.180 --> 00:17:21.220
If this attack connects, Gauche is finished!

00:17:21.890 --> 00:17:26.270
I send Heroic Challenger - Sword Shield 
from my hand to the Cemetery!

00:17:27.190 --> 00:17:30.650
When I receive 2000 or more damage by battle,

00:17:36.740 --> 00:17:40.950
that damage is negated and my Life points become 100!

00:17:45.540 --> 00:17:48.500
Awesome, he survived again!

00:17:49.960 --> 00:17:52.500
He actually had such a card hidden in his hand?

00:17:53.670 --> 00:17:55.130
I will end my turn!

00:17:55.590 --> 00:17:57.380
Gauche's got 100 Life Points left!

00:17:57.630 --> 00:17:59.760
There's no way Robin won't win this!

00:17:59.930 --> 00:18:01.760
Well done, Robin-<i>sama</i>!

00:18:07.190 --> 00:18:09.020
My turn! Draw!

00:18:10.150 --> 00:18:10.690
<i>Yes!</i>

00:18:11.020 --> 00:18:14.070
I summon Heroic Challenger - Double Lance!

00:18:19.620 --> 00:18:24.580
This monster can be treated as 2 Xyz materials!

00:18:25.450 --> 00:18:25.910
What?

00:18:26.500 --> 00:18:27.080
That means...

00:18:28.040 --> 00:18:31.290
I overlay the LV 4 Double Lance which is treated as 2 materials!

00:18:34.590 --> 00:18:37.470
I build the Overlay Network with these two monsters!

00:18:38.090 --> 00:18:39.260
Xyz Summon!

00:18:41.140 --> 00:18:44.770
Show yourself, Heroic Champion - Excalibur!

00:18:56.030 --> 00:18:58.700
He actually preformed a Xyz summon
 in this dire situation?!

00:19:00.200 --> 00:19:04.790
It can only attack when I have 500 Life points or less.

00:19:05.290 --> 00:19:08.370
Here goes!!
 I activate Excalibur's monster effect!

00:19:08.830 --> 00:19:11.710
By detaching one overlay unit, its Attack power is doubled!

00:19:12.710 --> 00:19:14.250
Its Attack power became 4000?!

00:19:14.540 --> 00:19:16.630
But Robin's monster has 5000!

00:19:17.710 --> 00:19:19.380
It's still far off, even after doubling!

00:19:20.220 --> 00:19:23.760
I activate the Magic card from my hand, Heroic Chance!

00:19:24.180 --> 00:19:27.470
Excalibur's Attack power is doubled again!

00:19:30.140 --> 00:19:31.850
An Attack power of 8000?!

00:19:32.270 --> 00:19:33.980
So that's his goal?!

00:19:34.270 --> 00:19:38.530
Go, Excalibur! 
Attack Galaxy Destroyer!

00:19:39.320 --> 00:19:42.610
One-Sword Style Strike: Finishing Attack of True Sword!

00:19:45.200 --> 00:19:46.080
Impossible!

00:20:10.600 --> 00:20:11.390
Robin was...

00:20:12.190 --> 00:20:13.310
...defeated.

00:20:16.900 --> 00:20:17.980
Did I lose?

00:20:19.780 --> 00:20:20.570
Robin!

00:20:25.780 --> 00:20:26.530
Yuma.

00:20:28.580 --> 00:20:29.410
That was really fun.

00:20:30.500 --> 00:20:32.870
Yeah. I can tell by looking at you.

00:20:33.500 --> 00:20:34.460
It's all thanks to you.

00:20:35.130 --> 00:20:35.580
Wha-?

00:20:36.250 --> 00:20:39.000
After the battle with you, I realized...

00:20:39.800 --> 00:20:42.340
that dueling should be something you have fun with.

00:20:42.720 --> 00:20:43.300
Fuya!

00:20:46.260 --> 00:20:48.510
That was a good duel. I thank you.

00:20:48.970 --> 00:20:52.180
Me as well. I am very happy to have dueled with you.

00:20:56.060 --> 00:20:58.730
Did you really resign your 
position as an Operation Committee member?

00:20:59.020 --> 00:21:01.940
Yeah. In order to fight you.

00:21:02.400 --> 00:21:02.940
Me?!

00:21:03.530 --> 00:21:05.320
I'll definitely advance to the finals.

00:21:05.910 --> 00:21:06.740
I'll be waiting.

00:21:10.950 --> 00:21:14.370
Maybe he learned how to have fun dueling from you too.

00:21:14.620 --> 00:21:14.960
Huh?!

00:21:15.830 --> 00:21:19.960
It's strange. Everyone who dueled with you became happy.

00:21:20.550 --> 00:21:21.920
Fuya-<i>kun</i>!

00:21:23.340 --> 00:21:25.470
You possess that special ability,

00:21:26.380 --> 00:21:28.550
The ability to make people happy through dueling.

00:21:29.640 --> 00:21:31.350
Make people happy through dueling?

00:21:33.140 --> 00:21:35.940
I hope you can make more people happy in the future!

00:21:36.730 --> 00:21:39.060
Please keep winning for this cause!

00:21:47.570 --> 00:21:49.700
Ahh! Robin-<i>sama</i>!

00:21:49.910 --> 00:21:51.660
To make people happy through dueling...

00:21:52.160 --> 00:21:54.540
That's right, that's the way!

00:21:55.040 --> 00:21:56.160
Thank you, Robin!

00:21:56.620 --> 00:22:00.290
From here on out, I'll continue to 'bring it to 'em'!

00:22:03.800 --> 00:22:05.550
Yuma finally decided his own path...

00:22:06.170 --> 00:22:07.970
Then... I will as well...

00:22:19.690 --> 00:22:22.860
<i>Someone gave me some water.</i>

00:22:23.230 --> 00:22:28.780
<i>So I was able to paint a rainbow with ease.</i>

00:22:29.910 --> 00:22:34.700
<i>I want to become someone perfect.</i>

00:22:35.500 --> 00:22:37.750
<i>But it's very difficult.</i>

00:22:38.870 --> 00:22:41.330
<i>Even with me suffering,</i>

00:22:41.460 --> 00:22:45.420
<i>I can't seem to grasp victory.</i>

00:22:46.300 --> 00:22:48.220
<i>I want to bloom!</i>

00:22:48.760 --> 00:22:52.680
<i>I must be having some kind of weird dream.</i>

00:22:52.680 --> 00:22:55.720
<i>But If I must fulfill this,</i>

00:22:56.220 --> 00:22:59.020
<i>Then I don't mind being laughed at for it.</i>

00:22:59.190 --> 00:23:06.110
<i>Since it's because your limits are decided on your own.</i>

00:23:06.400 --> 00:23:09.150
<i>I'll show it, overcoming it to tomorrow.</i>

00:23:09.400 --> 00:23:13.620
<i>Ah, I'm aiming for the big blue sky.</i>

00:23:13.830 --> 00:23:15.580
<i>For all of its glory.</i>

00:23:15.580 --> 00:23:17.370
<i>The Freesia of Desire.</i>

00:23:19.120 --> 00:23:22.750
<i>All of those countless flower petals</i>

00:23:22.960 --> 00:23:25.800
<i>They came at the expense of</i>

00:23:26.630 --> 00:23:29.380
<i>me being able to reach those heights.</i>

00:23:29.760 --> 00:23:33.800
<i>Ah, even though I lost my way today,</i>

00:23:33.970 --> 00:23:35.640
<i>I still yearn for it.</i>

00:23:35.640 --> 00:23:37.930
<i>That Freesia of Desire.</i>

00:23:40.560 --> 00:23:43.730
While Yuma is desperately searching for the last Heart Piece,

00:23:44.360 --> 00:23:46.780
Shark appears before him all of the sudden.

00:23:47.530 --> 00:23:50.280
He has a berserk attitude, much different from usual.

00:23:51.150 --> 00:23:54.070
And another unexpected person appears in Yuma's sight as well.

00:23:54.620 --> 00:23:56.790
Shark, duel with me!

00:23:56.990 --> 00:23:58.910
Why are you losing on purpose?!

00:23:59.330 --> 00:24:01.500
You're III! What are you doing here?!

00:24:02.290 --> 00:24:03.830
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ZeXal!

00:24:04.170 --> 00:24:07.000
"Fighting for His Family: The Gentle Avenger, III!"

00:24:07.500 --> 00:24:09.010
I'm gonna bring it to 'em!

00:24:10.380 --> 00:24:15.220
I would like to introduce to you Gauche's ace monster: Heroic Champion - Excalibur!

00:24:15.430 --> 00:24:19.390
With its effect, it can double its attack power, so its a monster well worthy the name of "Champion".

00:24:19.520 --> 00:24:22.060
Me too! I'm a champion at 
eating quickly and getting up early!

00:24:22.140 --> 00:24:23.020
We don't need that.

00:24:23.060 --> 00:24:23.600
True...
